    <string name="stats_consent_title">Anonymous usage statistics</string>
    <string name="stats_consent_body">To understand how many devices use DuoLauncher, the app sends a random anonymous ID, its version, the UI language, the Android version and the device model name (e.g. Titan 2 Elite) to a statistics service on first launch, after an upgrade, and once a day.\n\nThe model is only a generic model name. No serial number, IMEI, Android ID or other unique identifier, IP address, location, contacts, installed app list, or any of your content is collected.\n\nYou can turn this off at any time in Settings - Privacy and statistics. Turning it off immediately deletes the local anonymous ID and stops all further reports. Declining does not affect any launcher feature.</string>
